---
/**
 * Chapter 10 — what is published, under what licence, and why nothing is filled.
 *
 * Lifted out of `pages/index.astro` unchanged when the document became ten
 * routes.
 */
import { hourlyObservationsShort } from "../lib/data";
---

<section id="data" class="page">
  <p class="eyebrow">第十章</p>
  <h1>資料與方法</h1>

  <p class="lede">
    所有數字都可以獨立重算。原始資料來自環境部空氣品質監測網公開的年度逐時檔，
    管線、品管規則、分析程式全部開源。
  </p>

  {/*
    A list, not three cards.

    Three cards across this column gave each description 298px, which is
    eleven Chinese characters a line — the narrowest measure on the site, in a
    section whose whole job is explaining what you can download. And the three
    are a sequence rather than a set of alternatives: the same observations at
    coarsening resolution. A term-and-description list says that, and gives the
    prose a width it can be read at.
  */}
  <dl class="layers">
    <dt>L0 站-月</dt>
    <dd>每個測項一個 JSON，含月均值與該月的有效天數。網站直接讀這一層。</dd>

    <dt>L1 站-日</dt>
    <dd>每個測項一個 Parquet，共 54.6 MB。供 DuckDB-WASM 或桌面工具使用。</dd>

    <dt>L2 站-時</dt>
    <dd>
      {hourlyObservationsShort}筆完整逐時觀測，含每一筆的品管旗標。<strong>不發布</strong>——
      只發衍生產物與完整管線，執行一次 <code>twair ingest</code> 加{" "}
      <code>twair build</code> 即可獨立重建。
    </dd>
  </dl>

  <div class="note caveat">
    <strong>關於缺值。</strong>
    這個專案不補值。無效值標記但不刪除、超出物理範圍的值保留原數字以供檢視、
    覆蓋率不足的聚合直接<strong>不給平均值</strong>——寧可留一個洞，
    也不給一個有偏誤的數字。網站上每條線的中斷都是真的中斷。
  </div>

  <div class="note">
    <strong>逐時 PM2.5 的官方但書。</strong>
    環境部 ReadMe 載明：PM2.5 自動監測（貝他射線衰減法）的小時值僅供預警參考，
    不宜直接與 24 小時空氣品質標準比較。本站的日均、年均由小時值聚合而來，
    引用時請一併理解這個限制。
  </div>
</section>

<style>
/*
 * Term beside description, hairline between rows. The term column sizes to
 * its content so the descriptions all start on one line, and they are capped
 * at the page measure like every other paragraph rather than stretching to
 * whatever the column happens to be.
 */
.layers {
  display: grid;
  gap: 0 var(--space-4);
  margin: var(--space-4) 0;
}
@media (min-width: 40rem) {
  .layers {
    grid-template-columns: auto minmax(0, var(--measure));
  }
}
.layers dt {
  font-weight: 650;
  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  white-space: nowrap;
  padding: var(--space-3) 0;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--line-soft);
}
.layers dd {
  margin: 0;
  color: var(--text-muted);
  padding: var(--space-3) 0;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--line-soft);
  text-wrap: pretty;
}
/* On one column the term and its description are one row, so only the term
   carries the rule. */
@media (max-width: 39.999rem) {
  .layers dd {
    border-top: 0;
    padding-top: 0;
  }
}
</style>
